message: "Please cite this software release and the associated manuscript when using this work."
type: software
title: "Spatial capillary correction for driven multiphase-field junctions"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-22
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23614984"
url: "https://github.com/AJayQ8/spatial-capillary-junction-correction"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AJayQ8/spatial-capillary-junction-correction"
authors:
  - family-names: Alzanki
    given-names: Ayas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3121-3778"
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - phase-field
  - multiphase-field
  - triple junction
  - capillary correction
  - OpenPhase
abstract: >-
  Research code, benchmark inputs, exported figure data and manuscript sources
  for a spatial capillary correction of driven junction motion in
  double-obstacle multiphase-field simulations. The release includes B2 kernels,
  an OpenPhase integration caller and a declared source-based reconstruction
  of the Grose-Asimow comparator.
